Here is the corrected and complete C source code for the XDP program.

The diagnostic errors occurred because the `struct tcphdr` type was not defined. The original code included the necessary kernel headers for IP and Ethernet but missed the TCP header definition. Adding `#include <linux/tcp.h>` resolves the compilation errors.

